        "caption": "RAGAS matched humans 95 / 78 / 70 percent across the three legs (verified, paper Table 1). A naive ask-GPT-to-rank baseline scored only 54 / 40 / 52 on the same data (verified), so the decomposition genuinely beats vibes-based judging."
