    "excerpt": "A React Native AI feature lives inside three native limits web code ignores: a 16.67ms frame budget, a network you don't control, and an OS that suspends your JS the moment the user leaves. Here's how token streaming, fetch, and background tasks actually behave, and the architecture that survives a subway ride.",
