        "kind": "p",
        "text": "Trained routers are real and genuinely impressive. The RouteLLM paper (LMSYS) learns a win-rate predictor from Chatbot Arena preference data, then routes a query to the strong model only when predicted quality justifies it. The abstract reports 'over 2 times' cost reduction in certain cases without compromising quality, and the routers show transfer learning: swap the strong and weak models at test time and performance holds. The project README goes further, claiming up to 85% cost reduction while maintaining 95% of GPT-4's performance on MT Bench."
