        "kind": "figure",
        "caption": "Cross-provider failover on a timeout. Same model, second provider, and the receipt (`modelAttempts`) records both the timed-out attempt and the successful one.",
        "diagram": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant App\n    participant GW as Gateway\n    participant A as Anthropic\n    participant B as Bedrock\n    App->>GW: model=claude, order=[anthropic,bedrock]\n    GW->>A: try primary\n    A-->>GW: no first token by 10s\n    GW->>B: failover\n    B-->>GW: 200, first token\n    GW-->>App: stream + modelAttempts"
