        "caption": "Capability tier, model-level fallback, latency sort, and a fast-failover timeout in one call. All four dials, no science project. Field names match the AI Gateway provider-options docs.",
        "code": "import { streamText } from \"ai\";\n\nconst tier = classify(prompt);\nconst { primary, fallback } = TIERS[tier];\n\nconst result = streamText({\n  model: primary,\n  prompt,\n  providerOptions: {\n    gateway: {\n      models: [fallback],                            // model-level failover: try a backup model\n      sort: \"ttft\",                                  // among providers, fastest first token wins\n      providerTimeouts: { byok: { openai: 10000 } }, // fail fast at 10s, then next provider\n    },\n  },\n});"
