    "excerpt": "A 429 with an empty body is a slammed door with no sign. Done right, rate limiting is a running conversation: budgets the client can read, fairness by partition key, the difference between limiting and load shedding, and retries that don't restart the stampede. A tour through the IETF RateLimit draft, Stripe, Cloudflare, GitHub, and AWS.",
    "readingMinutes": 9,
