    "excerpt": "When AI agents generate scientific analysis at machine speed, the unit that has to survive review is not the answer but the trail behind it. A developer-level tour of auditable artifacts: provenance chains, data leakage, background review, reproducible compute, and where human review actually goes.",
    "readingMinutes": 9,
