    "excerpt": "Downloading Llama 3.1 405B isn't picking a smarter model. It's adopting an 810GB workload, a custom license with a 700M-user tripwire, and an on-call rotation. Here's the real trade: control and customization on one side, VRAM math and maintenance on the other.",
