        "kind": "figure",
        "diagram": "flowchart LR\n    DS[\"Regression dataset (JSONL)\"]:::ink\n    M[\"Model under test\"]:::ink\n    G[\"Graders\"]:::ink\n    T{\"Threshold\"}:::ink\n    DS -->|\"item.input + item.ideal\"| M\n    M -->|\"sample.output_text\"| G\n    G -->|\"scores 0..1\"| T\n    T -->|\"pass-rate above gate\"| PASS[\"Release\"]:::good\n    T -->|\"below gate\"| FAIL[\"Block\"]:::bad",
