        "text": "The dataset is plain **JSONL**, one test case per line. In the hosted API each row is wrapped as `{\"item\": {\"ticket_text\": \"...\", \"correct_label\": \"refund\"}}`, and your `item_schema` (a JSON Schema) declares which fields are required. Graders reach into a row with `{{ item.correct_label }}` and into the generation with `{{ sample.output_text }}`. Set `include_sample_schema: true` when a grader needs to see the model's output, which is almost always."
