        "text": "The cookbook's method: hand-label a set of pass/fail traces, then split them and measure the judge against human labels using **True Positive Rate** (does it catch real failures) and **True Negative Rate** (does it leave good answers alone). You want both high. Chasing only one gives you either a judge that never blocks anything or one that blocks everything."
